# Vercel > Project Settings > Environment Variables > Production.
# Root Directory: apps/web; Framework: Vite; Build: npm run build; Output: dist.
# Optional: code already defaults to /api/v1. vercel.json proxies /api to Render.
# If the Render service changes, update the rewrite destination in vercel.json.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1

# Optional Google login: use the same public client ID as Render GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID.
# VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=YOUR_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.com
# VITE_* values are public and embedded at build time. Never put secrets here.
